<title><![CDATA[I’ll put the syrup recipe below! I’m very excited to make so...]]></title>
<link>https://prank-arum.GIThub.io/Feeds/TikTok/susi.vidal/7698489203738397965.mp4</link>
<guid>https://tiktok.com/embed/7698489203738397965</guid>
<description>
<![CDATA[I’ll put the syrup recipe below! I’m very excited to make so many different and delicious coffees in the near future :) and force my friends to try them hahahaha Toast 6 crushed cardamom pods in a pot on low-med heat for 1-2 min. Add 1 orange peel, 1 lemon peel, 1 cinnamon stick, 1/2cup honey, 1/2cup water, dash of vanilla, and a pinch of salt. Stir and bring to a simmer for 10-15min. Strain and store in a mason jar in the fridge!  **it’ll thicken up once it cools. I used the syrup when it was still warm because I was impatient lolll
<img src="https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-p-0068-tx/oEwvDfNZBBH1ingCDWih0oIzaApIpQqw1VIXOA~tplv-tiktokx-origin.image?dr=9636&amp;x-expires=1793152800&amp;x-signature=2OflN2NSb2NS6YK9tPuaekLJ6Js%3D&amp;t=4d5b0474&amp;ps=13740610&amp;shp=81f88b70&amp;shcp=43f4a2f9&amp;idc=useast8" /><br><a href="https://tiktok.com/@susi.vidal/video/7698489203738397965">FULL POST</a> | <a href="https://tiktok.com/embed/7698489203738397965">EMBED</a> | <a href="https://ezgif.com/rotate-video?url=https://prank-arum.GIThub.io/Feeds/TikTok/susi.vidal/7698489203738397965.mp4">REVERSED</a><br>]]>
